      "statement": "celld tests three promises: an acknowledged write is durable, a cell has one writer at a time, and code written for Cloudflare Workers/Durable Objects operates the same on celld, at four layers: differential conformance, a model-checked specification, deterministic simulation, and live fleet fault injection.",
